# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing temperature"
msgstr "Strygetemperatur"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature while this filament irons. The nozzle goes back to the "
"print temperature once ironing is done. 0 means no change."
msgstr ""
"Dysetemperatur, mens dette filament stryger. Dysen vender tilbage til "
"printtemperaturen, når strygningen er færdig. 0 betyder ingen ændring."
